_:n28c7310b489d4e94980b2b472c7daf55b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType for Predicate Map can only be a rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, or rml:UnsafeURI;\n        " .
