_:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Subject Map element to generate a subject for generated RDF triples.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLanguageMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Language Map.\n    " .
