<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:DatatypeMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference, or rml:constant\n    with the IRI of the datatype.\n    " .
_:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb11 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the child of the object component for joining.\n        " .
_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either an rml:object or rml:objectMap must be provided, not multiple\n        " .
_:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:PredicateObjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
