_:n28b47c3eefe8480095c8fe2e78b6edc7b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be either rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, rml:UnsafeURI, rml:Literal, or rml:BlankNode for a Term Map.\n        May only be provided once.\n        " .
_:n10f35ca78eb74333b4c5cc76f96e87e8b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:parentTriplesMap may only be provided once and must be an IRI\n        or Blank Node referring to a Triples Map.\n        " .
_:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
