_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n89f6bf34a38c4918ade0407a13a5f18bb5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:reference must be a string.\n        " .
