_:na69145fdf34b4648af066b35229526bcb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "rml:constant of a LanguageMap must be a plain string, not a language-tagged literal." .
_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicate> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Abstract Logical Source" .
_:n5d3beda3bb684adca0527e867a1e7d96b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n        The logical iterator (rml:iterator) defines the iteration loop used to \r\n        map the data of the input source. Depends on the reference formulation\r\n        if an iterator is necessary.  \r\n        " .
_:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b18 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/parentMap> .
