_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#BlankNodeOrIRI> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GraphMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Term Map is an Expression Map with optionally a term type specified.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLAbstractExpressionMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ExpressionMap" .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicate> .
_:n0dbd3c60d83d4cb581c8444b5f3f496db8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:datatypeMap must point to a rml:DatatypeMap specifying the\n        datatype of the Literal.\n        " .
