_:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Exactly one rml:logicalSource is required to access the data source.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Graph Map.\n    " .
