<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b14 .
_:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/childMap> .
_:n28b47c3eefe8480095c8fe2e78b6edc7b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n28b47c3eefe8480095c8fe2e78b6edc7b4 .
