_:n10f35ca78eb74333b4c5cc76f96e87e8b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n0dbd3c60d83d4cb581c8444b5f3f496db9 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Language tag for the object.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> .
_:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb9 .
_:n61dc9945065e4807b448a975095afe0eb10 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/child> .
_:n8fe17e9dda2a48839b23a07e16ff9b67b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:objectMap must be an IRI or blank node and be provided once.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapORPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:n89f6bf34a38c4918ade0407a13a5f18bb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:n07f0f36d64e944acafb73dd8ea977ce5b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be an rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI, rml:URI,\n        rml:UnsafeURI, or rml:BlankNode for a Graph Map.\n        " .
_:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b16 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n24a3fdfa67c0462689f14edef720b926b17 .
